package Physics.Tests

/*
Spheres that are well away from the triangle, off to the side and far
above, give no contact.

Unless a test says otherwise, the triangle is the standard one with no
margin, and the triangle is item A, the way terrain calls it. A stored
contact's normal then points from the sphere toward the triangle, and
its point on B is on the sphere's surface.
*/
class SphereTriangleOutOfReachTest is PhysicsTest
    on create
        SetName("Sphere and triangle: out of reach")
    end

    action Run
        CheckWhole("sphere off to the side", RunSphere(3, 0.1, 0, 0.5, 0.04, false):GetPointCount(), 0)
        CheckWhole("sphere far above", RunSphere(0.25, 5, -0.25, 0.5, 0.04, false):GetPointCount(), 0)
        CheckWhole("sphere just past an edge", RunSphere(0.5, 0, 0.6, 0.5, 0, false):GetPointCount(), 0)
    end
end
